# Decor bush, native 32x24 frames: idle, brush1 (leaning with the hero), brush2 (rebound), settle.
# The runtime mirrors the sheet for the hero's heading, so the lean is drawn once. Bottom row rests on the floor.
# Decor tier (D76, #344): a muted slate, contour in its own darker slate, no ink 0b0814, no accent hue. The bottom row
# is a lighter foot (f) where the bush meets the floor's lit top, so its edge there does not pop.
# Forest recolour (#236, D108, 2026-11-20): tones in order k < N < d < m < l (OKLab L 0.170 to 0.274, chroma 0.015, hue 250),
# between forest-1's near-black ground and the night sky behind forest-0 and forest-2 (D108 band 0.08..0.20). The forest-2 bush that
# stood at x 1040, in front of the third-party cliff tiles (#189), moved to x 1060 (placement fix, no palette change).
size 32 24
color k 0a1016
color d 191f25
color m 1b2127
color l 22282f
color n 1e2227
color N 14181c
color f 21272e
frame idle
